12 km NAM (NMMB core, NAM v4.2) on cloud computers and publish its output as FrankenNAM. It is not affiliated
with or endorsed by NOAA, NCEP or EMC. FrankenNAM products are not produced by NOAA, and nothing here may be
read as stating or implying NOAA endorsement.

